      "role": "user",
      "content": "i guess i am just tired of the waiting. everything is a struggle now. even just getting up to make tea feels like a mountain. it feels like i've already lived my life, and now i'm just... lingering. does that make any sense? it's like being stuck in a waiting room for a doctor who is never going to call your name.",
